## Interface: 16001, 120105, 120107
## Title: ARL Extensions: Auctionator
## Notes: The ARL tab on the auction house: Darkmoon (the Faire's whereabouts, the cheapest Prize Tickets and reputation), Logistics (the cheapest supply camp reputation and Merchant's Favor) and Snipes (auctions below vendor price), a Buy next button for their plans, and one Auction House settings entry.
## Author: aredpanda, andreg1
## Version: 0.23.2
## Group: ARLExtensions
## Dependencies: ARLExtensions
## OptionalDeps: Auctionator, ItemTree
## LoadOnDemand: 1
## X-ARLE-Pack: Auctionator
## X-ARLE-Group: Auctionator
## X-ARLE-Features: AuctionHouse, DarkmoonTickets, Logistics, Snipes
## X-ARLE-Feature-AuctionHouse: title=Auction House; extends=Auctionator; cmd=ah; default=off
## X-ARLE-Feature-DarkmoonTickets: title=Darkmoon Faire; extends=Auctionator; cmd=dmf; default=off; replaces=Auctionator_DarkmoonTickets; hidden=1
## X-ARLE-Feature-Logistics: title=Logistics; extends=Auctionator; cmd=logistics; default=off; hidden=1
## X-ARLE-Feature-Snipes: title=Snipes; extends=Auctionator; cmd=snipes; default=off; hidden=1

